Route23_Text_VictoryRoadGateSign::
    .string "VICTORY ROAD GATE -\n"
    .string "POKéMON LEAGUE$"

Route23_Text_WayneIntro::
	.string "Every step north of here weighs\n"
	.string "more than the last.\p"
	.string "Show me your legs can carry your\n"
	.string "BADGES.$"

Route23_Text_WayneRematchIntro::
	.string "Back on the final road?\p"
	.string "Then climb with purpose again.$"

Route23_Text_WayneDefeat::
	.string "Your footing held.$"

Route23_Text_WaynePostBattle::
	.string "ROUTE 23 is not here to hurry you.\p"
	.string "It gives you time to understand\n"
	.string "what you have earned.$"

Route23_Text_ChesterIntro::
	.string "Birds go quiet near VICTORY ROAD.\p"
	.string "Even they know this place asks\n"
	.string "for respect.$"

Route23_Text_ChesterRematchIntro::
	.string "The air is still again.\p"
	.string "My birds are ready to test your\n"
	.string "resolve.$"

Route23_Text_ChesterDefeat::
	.string "The silence won.$"

Route23_Text_ChesterPostBattle::
	.string "A loud trainer stands out here.\p"
	.string "A prepared trainer listens first.$"

Route23_Text_ErnestIntro::
	.string "No showing off on this road.\p"
	.string "If you battle on ROUTE 23, battle\n"
	.string "like you mean it.$"

Route23_Text_ErnestRematchIntro::
	.string "You came back with the same steady\n"
	.string "look.\p"
	.string "Good. Let's battle again.$"

Route23_Text_ErnestDefeat::
	.string "You meant it.$"

Route23_Text_ErnestPostBattle::
	.string "The LEAGUE gate changes people.\p"
	.string "Even rough trainers learn to keep\n"
	.string "their voice down here.$"

Route23_Text_ZeekIntro::
	.string "The road narrows your thoughts\n"
	.string "until only the next step matters.\p"
	.string "Battle me with that focus.$"

Route23_Text_ZeekRematchIntro::
	.string "Same road. Same pressure.\p"
	.string "Let's see if your focus still\n"
	.string "holds.$"

Route23_Text_ZeekDefeat::
	.string "Focus held.$"

Route23_Text_ZeekPostBattle::
	.string "I used to think strength was all\n"
	.string "noise.\p"
	.string "ROUTE 23 taught me it can be\n"
	.string "quiet too.$"

Route23_Text_CoreyIntro::
	.string "People pass the guards and start\n"
	.string "walking like champions already.\p"
	.string "This road checks that attitude.$"

Route23_Text_CoreyRematchIntro::
	.string "Still walking like you belong?\p"
	.string "Good. Prove it again.$"

Route23_Text_CoreyDefeat::
	.string "You belong.$"

Route23_Text_CoreyPostBattle::
	.string "The BADGES open the path.\p"
	.string "They don't carry you up it.\n"
	.string "That's still on you.$"

Route23_Text_MalikIntro::
	.string "The last stretch before VICTORY\n"
	.string "ROAD strips away excuses.\p"
	.string "Let's see what's left.$"

Route23_Text_MalikRematchIntro::
	.string "No excuses this time either.\p"
	.string "Just the road, your POKéMON,\n"
	.string "and mine.$"

Route23_Text_MalikDefeat::
	.string "Nothing left but respect.$"

Route23_Text_MalikPostBattle::
	.string "If you can keep moving after every\n"
	.string "guard, every climb, every battle...\p"
	.string "then VICTORY ROAD will know your\n"
	.string "name.$"
